    "created_at": "2019-02-11T15:15:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-02-11T15:15:52Z",
    "body": "Per https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-mixed-content/#should-block-fetch it should work, but it might not be a bad idea to disallow it given it's a somewhat problematic practice and a new context for loading such problematic resources.\r\n\r\ncc @mikewest",
