    "created_at": "2019-02-11T15:24:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-02-11T15:24:53Z",
    "body": "It looks like our implementation issues a warning from Document-contexts, but blocks the request from Worker-contexts. I don't think we currently have metrics in place for measuring how often this is used, but in principle I agree that disallowing it might be a good idea.",
